<h1>Claudia Peralta</h1>
<p>Chicago Board of Education, District 1b, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Endorsed by the Chicago Teachers Union.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.communityforclaudia.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (communityforclaudia.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Peralta says every family deserves access to a high-quality, fully funded public neighborhood school regardless of neighborhood, language, or their children&#39;s abilities. She says she wants to bring a community-centered, problem-solving approach to the board and be an advocate and voice for families across the district, building a school system that meets the needs of every student.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>She serves as district director for U.S. Rep. Delia Ramirez and previously was chief of staff to State Rep. Lindsey LaPointe. She is a CPS parent, CPS graduate, and former Local School Council member.</p>
